UID:paloma-morphy-miami@shotgun.live
DTSTAMP:20261111T101835Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261111T101835Z
SEQUENCE:3
DTSTART:20270512T230000Z
DTEND:20270513T060000Z
SUMMARY:Paloma Morphy
LOCATION:ZeyZey Miami\, 353 Northeast 61st Street\, Miami\, FL 33137\, USA
DESCRIPTION:Paloma Morphy With special guest(s) to be announced soon. Where
 : ZeyZey Miami 353 NE 61 Street Miami\, Florida\, 33137 When: May 12\, 202
 7 <-- rescheduled date! Doors: 7:00 PM Age: 18+ An Escala Sonora Event Pow
 ered by: Mishu --- Miami is set for a captivating night as Paloma Morphy\,
  the rising singer-songwriter from Monterrey\, Mexico\, brings her emotion
 ally raw and genre-bending sound to ZeyZey on September 30. Fresh off a br
 eakout year that saw her win the 2025 Latin GRAMMY for Best New Artist and
  earn recognition from Rolling Stone\, Apple Music\, Spotify\, and Billboa
 rd as one of the most exciting emerging voices in Latin music\, Paloma is 
 redefining modern pop through vulnerability\, minimalist production\, and 
 striking storytelling. With over 50 million streams on her debut album 'Au
 ' and sold-out shows across Mexico\, her live performances feel intimate\,
  honest\, and deeply immersive. Don’t miss the chance to experience one 
 of Latin pop’s fastest-rising artists in Miami this fall\nLineup: Paloma
  Morphy\nTags: indie pop\, latin\, pop\nPresented by: Mishu\nTickets: GA -
  Tier 1 $20 (sold out)\, GA - Tier 2 $25\nhttps://shotgun.live/en/events/p
 aloma-morphy-miami\nhttps://calendar.zeyzeymiami.com/shows/paloma-morphy-1
 2-may
URL:https://shotgun.live/en/events/paloma-morphy-miami
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:indie pop,latin,pop
GEO:25.8327584;-80.1890685
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
